40:27.540 --> 40:28.380
Kembalilah.

40:29.050 --> 40:30.140
Kembalilah!

40:51.810 --> 40:52.690
Liu Shao.

40:54.120 --> 40:55.130
Aku mohon padamu.

40:55.840 --> 40:56.810
